  title: `Sak Tahn Waax: The Named Maya Mathematician Behind a Planetary Formula`,
  description: `A wall text at Xultun attributes a sophisticated 781 CE calendrical formula involving Venus, Mars and Maya time cycles to Sak Tahn Waax.`,
  published: `2026-07-16T11:15:00.000Z`,
