  title: `Scythian Golden Man DNA: Were Steppe Elites Born Into Power?`,
  description: `Genome-wide data from the Golden Man and 84 other Iron Age individuals suggest that Scythian elite status often moved through family networks.`,
  published: `2026-07-16T12:00:00.000Z`,
