  title: "Iran\u2013US Conflict 2026: What Is Happening and Why the Strait of Hormuz Matters",
  description: "A dated, evidence-led guide to the 2026 Iran\u2013US conflict, the Strait of Hormuz, nuclear negotiations, Gulf bases and possible escalation paths.",
