  title: "Who Are the Houthis? Yemen, Iran and the Red Sea Attacks Explained",
  description: "An evidence-led guide to the Houthi movement, Zaydi history, Yemen\u2019s civil war, Iranian support and attacks affecting Red Sea shipping.",
